{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50349","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 二、白龙堆咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 二、白龙堆咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传道神沙异，喧寒[也自鸣][八]。\n[势]疑天鼓[九]动，殷似地雷惊。\n九[削棱还峻]，人跻刃不平。\n更寻[一○]掊井处，时[见白龙行]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}